WEBVTT

00:11:59.423 --> 00:12:02.426
and understanding that it wasn't
necessarily a space anymore.

00:12:02.843 --> 00:12:05.095
And I think for you
it might be something else.

00:12:05.095 --> 00:12:07.264
We all channel that in different ways.

00:12:07.681 --> 00:12:08.682
But for me,

00:12:08.682 --> 00:12:13.020
that moment of joy, of sorrow, of freedom,

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.313
of creativity,

00:12:14.313 --> 00:12:16.982
that moment between
the “action” and the “cut,”

00:12:16.982 --> 00:12:18.650
that’s what felt like home.

00:12:19.109 --> 00:12:20.611
And I’m very grateful for that.

00:12:21.403 --> 00:12:22.446
Thank you.

00:12:22.446 --> 00:12:29.411
(Applause and cheers)